izes in blood spatter, tasked with using his expert skill set to solve the disappearances of multiple persons in the snowy region of Haywood. In the darkness of a Tudor mansion, you hear the foghorn blow. You are not alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.poster.avif?t=1759595536\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.webm?t=1759595536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7a567bda6d865343d29ad7b3b1b5f207.mp4?t=1759595536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > ENVIRONMENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the dimly lit halls of an ancient home to the haze-covered docks of Haywood itself, journey through handcrafted environments to look for evidence that will help you in your journey. Be sure to search every nook and cranny, as there is a story to be told in every corner. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.poster.avif?t=1759595536\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.webm?t=1759595536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/extras/7533d57052bb815ee7ddc25f048ba89a.mp4?t=1759595536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cMurder is seldom senseless, it's targeted.\u201d </i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2014 Charles Dalton</strong></p>","developers":["Blue Hat Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3062610/beaebc3ff3819ab67685da82777e16019247af1e/header.jpg?t=1759595536","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"She's Leaving is protected under British copyright laws.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1103481351/9c0c004773a3737060766c07ff57c8258d3839b1/1759145364/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759146164","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1103481351/9c0c004773a3737060766c07ff57c8258d3839b1/1759145364/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759146164","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3062610/1103481351/9c0c004773a3737060766c07ff57c8258d3839b1/1759145364/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759146164","id":257208512,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208512/movie480.mp4?t=1759146164","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208512/movie_max.mp4?t=1759146164"},"name":"She's Leaving - Release Date Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257208512/323b1d5c41c9f9d29e2933845ba45633081e840c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759146164","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208512/movie480.webm?t=1759146164","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257208512/movie_max.webm?t=1759146164"}}],"name":"She's Leaving","package_groups":[],"pc_requir